{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:32:24", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-b502e6c9-78f9-4d93-bd34-2fc5106dbc76', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Agent Management & Cleanup System"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LGTqBSa7qXmbTYS7ECWude', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DjaXMi8DyGoPcv3TW1yDqj', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True}}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01J5M63PK79tn31bB9tKJx1N', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LGTqBSa7qXmbTYS7ECWude', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Agent Management & Cleanup System - Requirements\\n\\n## Vision\\nThe user needs to manage failed agents more effectively and clean up old data to improve system performance. Specifically:\\n1. Retry failed agents automatically, and if they fail again, delete them permanently\\n2. Provide a way to delete old completed jobs\\n3. Address system slowness caused by data accumulation\\n\\n## Current State Analysis\\nThe existing system has:\\n- **Recovery system** (`swarm_recovery.py`): Handles agent recovery with multiple strategies (RETRY, ESCALATE_MODEL, ABORT, etc.)\\n- **Swarm state** (`swarm_state.py`): SQLite-backed state management with cleanup_old_data() method\\n- **Backend APIs** (`main.py`): Endpoints for recovery, cleanup, and retention management\\n- **Data retention** (`data_retention.py`): Existing retention management\\n\\n## Objectives\\n\\n### Objective 1: Retry Failed Agents with Auto-Delete on Second Failure\\n**Priority: HIGH**\\n\\nCreate a \\"retry and delete\\" feature that:\\n1. Allows user to retry all currently failed agents\\n2. Tracks retry attempts for each failed agent\\n3. Automatically deletes agents that fail a second time after retry\\n4. Shows clear status in the UI of what happened (retried, deleted, succeeded)\\n\\n**Technical Requirements:**\\n- Add new API endpoint: `POST /api/agents/retry-all-failed`\\n  - Finds all agents with status = \'failed\' \\n  - Queues each for retry with a \\"delete_on_failure\\" flag\\n  - Returns count of agents queued for retry\\n- Add new API endpoint: `POST /api/agents/{agent_id}/retry-and-delete`\\n  - Retries single agent, deletes if it fails again\\n- Modify recovery system to track \\"second_failure\\" and auto-delete\\n- Add frontend button \\"Retry All Failed (auto-delete on 2nd failure)\\"\\n\\n### Objective 2: Delete Old Completed Jobs\\n**Priority: HIGH**\\n\\nCreate a job cleanup feature that:\\n1. Shows list of old completed jobs/sessions\\n2. Allows bulk deletion by age (e.g., \\"Delete jobs older than 7 days\\")\\n3. Allows individual deletion of specific completed jobs\\n4. Includes confirmation before destructive actions\\n\\n**Technical Requirements:**\\n- Add new API endpoint: `DELETE /api/jobs/completed`\\n  - Query params: `older_than_days` (optional), `session_ids` (optional list)\\n  - Deletes sessions and all associated data (agents, messages, events, etc.)\\n  - Returns count of deleted items\\n- Add new API endpoint: `GET /api/jobs/completed/stats`\\n  - Returns count and size of completed jobs, grouped by age\\n- Add frontend component for job cleanup:\\n  - Shows completed jobs with age\\n  - Bulk delete by age slider/dropdown\\n  - Individual delete buttons\\n  - Confirmation modal before delete\\n\\n### Objective 3: Performance Improvements\\n**Priority: MEDIUM**\\n\\nAddress system slowness by:\\n1. Adding database vacuuming after bulk deletes\\n2. Implementing smarter data loading (pagination, lazy loading)\\n3. Adding database size monitoring\\n4. Cleaning up orphaned data\\n\\n**Technical Requirements:**\\n- Add `VACUUM` after bulk deletes\\n- Add API to get database size: `GET /api/system/db-stats`\\n- Add cleanup of orphaned records (messages/events without parent agents)\\n- Consider adding index optimizations if needed\\n\\n## Scope Constraints\\n**IN SCOPE:**\\n- Backend API endpoints for the features above\\n- Frontend UI components for retry and cleanup\\n- Modifications to existing recovery system\\n- Documentation updates\\n\\n**OUT OF SCOPE:**\\n- Automatic scheduled cleanup (can be added later)\\n- Archive to external storage (just delete for now)\\n- Undo/recovery of deleted data\\n- Complex data migration\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n1. User can click one button to retry all failed agents\\n2. Agents that fail twice are automatically deleted\\n3. User can see and delete old completed jobs by age\\n4. System performance noticeably improves after cleanup\\n5. All existing functionality continues to work\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Must work with existing SQLite database schema\\n- Must not break existing API endpoints\\n- Must be accessible from the existing React frontend\\n- Should follow existing code patterns\\n\\n## Assumptions Made\\n- \\"Failed agents\\" means agents with status = \'failed\' in the database\\n- \\"Completed jobs\\" means sessions with status = \'completed\'\\n- \\"Delete\\" means permanent removal from database (no soft delete)\\n- Performance issues are primarily from data volume, not code issues\\n\\n## Files to Modify/Create\\n\\n### Backend (Python)\\n1. **src/runtime/agents/swarm_recovery.py** - Add retry-and-delete logic\\n2. **src/runtime/agents/swarm_state.py** - Add delete methods\\n3. **src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py** - Add new API endpoints\\n\\n### Frontend (React)\\n1. **New: src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/JobCleanupPanel.jsx** - UI for job cleanup\\n2. **Modify: RecoveryDashboard.jsx** - Add retry-all-failed button\\n3. **Modify: App.jsx** - Add navigation to cleanup panel\\n\\n## Implementation Priority\\n1. First: API endpoints for retry-all-failed and delete completed jobs\\n2. Second: Modify recovery system for auto-delete on second failure\\n3. Third: Frontend components\\n4. Fourth: Performance optimizations and testing\\n"}'}, {'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DjaXMi8DyGoPcv3TW1yDqj', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "tmux_monitoring_dashboard_implementation", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "eadership/development_manager.md", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "leadership/development_manager.md.pre_improvement", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/executive_director.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/executive_director.md.pre_improvement", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.1", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.2", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.3", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.4", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md", "status": "M"}], "untracked": ["docs/archive/index.md", "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/backend_implementation_plan_m3.md"]}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "f57958ab035753c52bf7a1402397e2e762bcb061", "message": "Complete Milestone 1 setup: API Cost Optimization research and documentation phase initiated", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "9 minutes ago"}, "history": [{"hash": "f57958ab035753c52bf7a1402397e2e762bcb061", "message": "Complete Milestone 1 setup: API Cost Optimization research and documentation phase initiated", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "9 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "7e54be9371ee12a85485c76535564da32a2e0fe3", "message": "Initial project setup for Tmux Monitoring Dashboard", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "17 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "f5c30d44529777f9401b64f6a436c04296771d2d", "message": "Complete Milestone 3: Full CLI Integration and Polish for Tmux Monitoring Dashboard", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "21 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "0b91cf675d9906a8b0d3971d312bc2549ffe1100", "message": "Complete Milestone 3: Full CLI Integration and Polish for Tmux Monitoring Dashboard - implemented Claude CLI integration, advanced log processing, configuration management system, robust error handling, and cross-platform compatibility features", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "22 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "017db01e1eedbe015d976d87c4730760912bd86f", "message": "Complete Milestone 2 Integration and Testing: comprehensive testing achieved with 95% coverage and sub-millisecond performance", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "23 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "476015b52cdfb1c8c2660e0bbaa7fbf0e548e992", "message": "Complete Milestone 2: Enhanced Task Monitoring with real-time tracking", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "24 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "7f7ce8b59169360f3b44a54332e854f54acb860c", "message": "Complete TDD Coordinator model validation with comprehensive performance report", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "24 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "80509b30d6cd7a13eaa6c9d5f9cfcf3668dedf9a", "message": "Complete backend implementation and testing for TDD Coordinator model validation A/B testing framework", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "25 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "b72edcd8bdc67384c51b097bf4f11919bcaff5c8", "message": "Complete Milestone 1: Basic Tmux Layout for Monitoring Dashboard", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "27 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "24e4cfbfe17daa33a6ee682dee447d88770e5f8d", "message": "Complete milestone 3: final deployment preparation for activity tracking system", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "28 minutes ago"}], "stash_count": 0}'}, {'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01J5M63PK79tn31bB9tKJx1N', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "project_id required for get_summary"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_019ndmTCu3ekzsg1Z4r67sMx', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Management & Cleanup System', 'description': 'Implement retry-and-delete for failed agents, job cleanup features, and performance improvements for the ensemble UI system'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_019ndmTCu3ekzsg1Z4r67sMx', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "62a796ef", "message": "Created project: Agent Management & Cleanup System", "summary": {"project_id": "62a796ef", "project_name": "Agent Management & Cleanup System", "description": "Implement retry-and-delete for failed agents, job cleanup features, and performance improvements for the ensemble UI system", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T23:27:44.203026", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T23:27:44.203026", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T23:27:44.203026", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Agent Management & Cleanup System\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011HNVwPr8r9oPP8NZ1HcBgf', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Agent Management & Cleanup System - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nImplementation of retry-and-delete functionality for failed agents, job cleanup features, and performance improvements.\n\n## Milestone 1: Backend API Foundation\n**Objective**: Create all backend API endpoints for retry-failed and job cleanup functionality\n\n**Deliverables**:\n1. `POST /api/agents/retry-all-failed` - Queue all failed agents for retry with delete_on_failure flag\n2. `POST /api/agents/{agent_id}/retry-and-delete` - Retry single agent with auto-delete\n3. `DELETE /api/jobs/completed` - Delete completed jobs by age or session IDs\n4. `GET /api/jobs/completed/stats` - Get stats on completed jobs grouped by age\n5. Modify `swarm_recovery.py` to track second_failure and auto-delete\n6. Modify `swarm_state.py` to add delete methods for agents and sessions\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- All endpoints return correct responses\n- Database operations complete without errors\n- Retry logic correctly tracks failure count\n- Auto-delete triggers on second failure\n- Unit tests pass for all new functionality\n\n**Dependencies**: None (first milestone)\n\n**Estimated Effort**: Medium\n\n---\n\n## Milestone 2: Frontend Components\n**Objective**: Create UI components for retry-failed and job cleanup features\n\n**Deliverables**:\n1. Add "Retry All Failed (auto-delete on 2nd failure)" button to RecoveryDashboard\n2. Create `JobCleanupPanel.jsx` component with:\n   - List of completed jobs with age\n   - Bulk delete by age slider/dropdown\n   - Individual delete buttons\n   - Confirmation modal\n3. Add navigation to JobCleanupPanel in App.jsx\n4. Status indicators showing retry/delete outcomes\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Buttons call correct API endpoints\n- UI updates reflect operation results\n- Confirmation dialogs work correctly\n- Error states handled gracefully\n- Responsive design maintained\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 (backend APIs must exist)\n\n**Estimated Effort**: Medium\n\n---\n\n## Milestone 3: Performance Optimizations\n**Objective**: Improve system performance through database optimizations\n\n**Deliverables**:\n1. Add VACUUM after bulk deletes\n2. `GET /api/system/db-stats` endpoint for database size monitoring\n3. Orphaned data cleanup (messages/events without parent agents)\n4. Index optimizations if needed\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Database size reduces after cleanup operations\n- Bulk operations don\'t cause performance degradation\n- Orphaned records properly identified and removed\n- System responsiveness improves noticeably\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1 and 2 (cleanup features must work)\n\n**Estimated Effort**: Low-Medium\n\n---\n\n## Milestone Summary\n\n| Milestone | Priority | Dependencies | Status |\n|-----------|----------|--------------|--------|\n| 1. Backend API Foundation | HIGH | None | Not Started |\n| 2. Frontend Components | HIGH | Milestone 1 | Not Started |\n| 3. Performance Optimizations | MEDIUM | Milestones 1, 2 | Not Started |\n\n## Technical Decisions Made\n1. **Retry tracking**: Will use a retry_count field in agent records\n2. **Delete strategy**: Hard delete, no soft delete or archiving\n3. **Confirmation UX**: Modal dialogs for destructive operations\n4. **Performance**: VACUUM after bulk operations to reclaim space\n'}}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_019hdBrxAeDtFEhk11GfeuAU', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': '62a796ef', 'description': 'Milestone 1: Backend API Foundation - Create retry-failed and job cleanup API endpoints', 'assigned_to': 'TDD Coordinator'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_011HNVwPr8r9oPP8NZ1HcBgf', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_232800.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/