{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:35:02", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-e2e017a7-b559-4eb1-b088-477e38a01579', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "metrics pane in the list of agent cost savings, the values are reversed. Opus is the most expensive, but is shown as the biggest cost improvememtn. Fix this please.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_015AAR6q52RByfHEWb9HEYCt', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Cost Savings Metrics Fix', 'description': 'Fix reversed cost savings values in metrics pane, ensuring accurate representation of agent costs'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015AAR6q52RByfHEWb9HEYCt', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "7b1ad4f4", "message": "Created project: Agent Cost Savings Metrics Fix", "summary": {"project_id": "7b1ad4f4", "project_name": "Agent Cost Savings Metrics Fix", "description": "Fix reversed cost savings values in metrics pane, ensuring accurate representation of agent costs", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T23:34:58.987020", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T23:34:58.987020", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T23:34:58.987020", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Agent Cost Savings Me