sing the low success rate\\n- **Root Cause Analysis**: Determine specific areas of weakness or confusion in the agent definition\\n\\n### Improvement Phase\\n- **Update Agent Definition**: Modify instructions, capabilities, or constraints as needed\\n- **Maintain Backwards Compatibility**: Ensure existing functionality remains intact\\n- **Performance Enhancement**: Focus on areas that will most improve success rate\\n\\n### Validation Phase\\n- **Test Changes**: If possible, validate that changes address identified issues\\n- **Document Changes**: Clear explanation of what was changed and why\\n- **Success Metrics**: Define how improvement will be measured\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- [ ] Current agent definition analyzed and issues identified\\n- [ ] Root causes of performance problems documented\\n- [ ] Agent definition updated with targeted improvements\\n- [ ] Changes tested and validated where possible\\n- [ ] Clear report of changes and expected impact provided\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Must not break existing functionality\\n- Changes should be targeted and specific to identified issues\\n- Must maintain the Executive Director\'s core role and authority\\n- Agent definition files located in leadership/ directory\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Executive Director agent definition file is accessible for review and modification\\n- Performance issues are related to definition clarity or instruction quality\\n- Improvements can be made through definition updates rather than code changes\\n- Target success rate of 75% is achievable through definition improvements\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Modifying the underlying agent execution system\\n- Changing the Executive Director\'s fundamental role or capabilities\\n- Performance improvements that would require architectural changes\\n- Modifications to other agents in the ensemble"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01CyhgZGJQiQaJRePTjKfBBV', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'c