rity:** High\n\n#### Objectives\n- Update interval options in the UI to 5s, 10s, 30s\n- Ensure proper functionality at each interval\n- Maintain existing default behavior\n\n#### Deliverables\n- Updated UI components with new interval options\n- Modified configuration/settings components\n- Updated interval handling logic\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] UI displays 5s, 10s, 30s options\n- [ ] Each option functions correctly\n- [ ] Default interval behavior preserved\n- [ ] No performance degradation\n\n### Milestone 3: Testing and Validation\n**Duration:** 1 day  \n**Priority:** Medium\n\n#### Objectives\n- Validate all interval options work correctly\n- Ensure no regressions in existing functionality\n- Performance testing at different intervals\n\n#### Deliverables\n- Test suite for interval functionality\n- Performance validation report\n- User acceptance testing completion\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] All tests pass\n- [ ] Performance meets requirements\n- [ ] No regressions identified\n\n## Dependencies\n- Clarification of actual requirements\n- Access to UI codebase\n- Testing environment\n\n## Risk Assessment\n- **High Risk:** Requirements ambiguity could lead to wrong implementation\n- **Medium Risk:** UI changes might affect other components\n- **Low Risk:** Testing may reveal performance issues\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Clarify requirements with Executive Director\n2. Analyze current UI implementation\n3. Begin technical implementation\n"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_018cGNGMUxkZPPcpsioxwLqZ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_235739.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_235739.md", "was_overwrit