{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 00:09:08", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-3ea622ef-9eb3-45e3-8b01-ae40c85acacc', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Analyze all available achievements and reduce any duplicate achievements. We want to have a roughly equivalent number of each rarity in each category. Add any new achievements that are needed to achieve this. Also add a category for robin hood men in tights, and a category for blazing saddles.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01455AjzXy2pBqi1SKeEwzQv', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Achievement Consolidation and Expansion', 'description': 'Analyze and reduce duplicate achievements, balance rarity across categories, and add new categories for Robin Hood: Men in Tights and Blazing Saddles'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01455AjzXy2pBqi1SKeEwzQv', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "4daa0bab", "message": "Created project: Achievement Consolidation and Expansion", "summary": {"project_id": "4daa0bab", "project_name": "Achievement Consolidation and Expansion", "description": "Analyze and reduce duplicate achievements, balance rarity across categories, and add new categories for Robin Hood: Men in Tights and Blazing Saddles", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T00:09:05.644635", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T00:09:05.644635", "task_