e thematically consistent with existing system\n\n## Success Criteria\n- No duplicate achievements remain\n- Each category has a balanced distribution of rarities\n- New movie-themed categories are fully integrated\n- Total number of achievements remains close to original count'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RX6foJwdyzWyYnRxVcBo7i', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260117_000914.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260117_000914.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01GDE8EPBNzGwbibPPVyoYpr', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'development_manager', 'input_data': {'project_id': '4daa0bab', 'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Achievement Consolidation and Expansion'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01GDE8EPBNzGwbibPPVyoYpr', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Unknown agent type: development_manager. Agent definition file not found."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01KCznUAoRu3xGdcN3ivRihw', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '4daa0bab', 'category': 'issue', 'note': 'Failed to spawn Development Manager. This requires immediate attention to resolve the agent configuration issue.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01KCznUAoRu3xGdcN3ivRihw', 'content': '{"success": true, "