{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 00:14:31", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-d58cd3a0-4368-45e4-9d44-d6c305354888', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "project_id": "4daa0bab",\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Achievement Consolidation and Expansion",\n  "context": "Analyze and consolidate achievements across categories, remove duplicates, and add new movie-themed categories"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RFboBkeRd1kcEwAS2ZFp7N', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RFboBkeRd1kcEwAS2ZFp7N', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Achievement System Consolidation and Expansion Requirements\\n\\n## Objectives\\n1. Identify and remove duplicate achievements across all categories\\n2. Balance achievement rarity within each category\\n3. Add two new movie-themed categories:\\n   - Robin Hood: Men in Tights\\n   - Blazing Saddles\\n\\n## Detailed Requirements\\n- Perform a comprehensive audit of existing achievements\\n- Ensure each category has a roughly equivalent distribution of rarities\\n  - Rare achievements\\n  - Epic achievements\\n  - Legendary achievements\\n- Create new achievement templates for the two new movie categories\\n- Maintain the o